    "elements": [
      {
        "type": "obj",
        "desc": "Haystacks down vest in sand beige matte nylon, sleeveless cut, laid flat and centered on the table, occupying roughly 75% of the frame height as the unambiguous focal subject. Horizontal baffle stitching runs across the body creating soft puffy down-filled channels with slight natural puffiness in each compartment and a faint sheen where down pushes outward. Front zipper runs vertically down the center with crisp teeth catching light, pull resting at mid-chest. Two zipped hand pockets at the lower hem with small metal pulls. Hood folded naturally to one side, drawcord tails trailing across the chest panel. No labels, tags, or logos visible."
      }
    ]
  }
